    "updated_at": "2022-04-01T13:11:57Z",
    "body": "This is caused by a popular \"async prompt\" package for fish, which has [a bug](https://github.com/acomagu/fish-async-prompt/issues/51). It always *had* a bug, but in fish 3.4.0 it triggers worse.\r\n\r\nThere is a PR to fix it: https://github.com/acomagu/fish-async-prompt/pull/52.\r\n\r\nThe simplest workaround is probably just to delete that package. I do not believe there is anything starship-related here.",
